msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ami「Thanks for hanging out with me today.＿It was like, SUPER fun.」"
msgstr "Ami「Gracias por salir conmigo hoy.＿Fue, o sea, SÚPER divertido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And thank you for inviting me. It was a＿nice change of pace.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y gracias por invitarme. Fue＿un buen cambio de aires.」"

msgid "Ami「Really? I'm glad to hear it①」"
msgstr "Ami「¿En serio? Me alegra oírlo①」"

msgid "Ami「I hated myself for not being able to do＿anything for you while you're suffering.」"
msgstr "Ami「Me odiaba por no poder hacer nada＿por ti mientras estás sufriendo.」"

msgid "Ami「So I wanted to try and cheer you up, if＿only slightly......」"
msgstr "Ami「Así que quería intentar animarte,＿aunque fuera un poco......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So that's why you invited me?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Así que por eso me invitaste?」"

msgid "Ami「Yeah...... Was I too nosy?」"
msgstr "Ami「Sí...... ¿Fui demasiado entrometida?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What are you saying? That's......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué estás diciendo? Eso......」"

msgid "Ami「I'd do anything if it's for you, Ryuuji.＿Your happiness is my happiness, after＿all.」"
msgstr "Ami「Haría lo que fuera por ti, Ryuuji.＿Tu felicidad es mi felicidad,＿después de todo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Y-You care about me that much......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿T-Te preocupas tanto por mí......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Thank you. You care about me more＿than anyone else, Ami-chan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Gracias. Te preocupas por＿mí más que nadie, Ami-chan.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji! What are you doing here?!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ryuuji! ¡¿Qué haces aquí?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「T-Taiga? Why are you here?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿T-Taiga? ¿Por qué estás aquí?」"

msgid "Taiga「That stupid chihuahua asked me to＿come!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Esa chihuahua tonta me＿pidió que viniera!」"

msgid "Ami「Whaaat～? I didn't call you or anything,＿Aisaka-san.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Quéee～? Yo no te llamé＿ni nada, Aisaka-san.」"

msgid "Taiga「You said \"I'll show you something＿interesting, so come here\"! StuChi!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Dijiste \"te mostraré algo interesante,＿ven aquí\"! ¡Chihuatonta!」"

msgid "Ami「Don't know what you're talking about～＿......Perhaps you were, like, stalking us,＿Aisaka-san?」"
msgstr "Ami「No sé de qué hablas～ ......¿Acaso nos＿estabas, o sea, espiando, Aisaka-san?」"

msgid "Taiga「Hmph! So you're gonna keep playing＿innocent...... That aside, Ryuuji, just＿how stupid are you?!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Jum! Así que te vas a seguir＿haciendo la inocente...... Ryuuji,＿¡¿qué tan tonto eres?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What......? Why did you have to call me＿stupid?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué......? ¿Por qué tenías＿que llamarme tonto?」"

msgid "Taiga「I called you stupid because you're an＿idiot!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Te llamé tonto porque eres un idiota!」"

msgid "Ami「You're so cruel, Aisaka-san. Apologize＿to Ryuuji!」"
msgstr "Ami「Qué cruel eres, Aisaka-san.＿¡Discúlpate con Ryuuji!」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryu- Ryu- \"Ryuuji\"!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Ryu- Ryu- \"Ryuuji\"?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji!! Why did you let this evil,＿sex-crazed, rotten chihuahua call you＿Ryuuji?!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Ryuuji!! ¡¿Por qué dejaste que＿esta chihuahua malvada, pervertida＿y podrida te llame Ryuuji?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Because her true nature is a stupid＿pure-evil nympho sheep in wolf's＿clothing!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Porque su verdadera naturaleza es＿la de una tonta ninfómana malvada,＿una oveja con piel de lobo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why are you being so cruel!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Por qué estás siendo tan cruel?!」"

msgid "Ami「Stop it, Ryuuji. I don't mind being＿insulted at all. I can't forgive anyone＿who insults you, though......」"
msgstr "Ami「Basta, Ryuuji. No me importa que me＿insulten. Pero no puedo perdonar a＿quien te insulte a ti......」"

msgid "Taiga「Excuse me? Don't make me laugh!＿What do you intend to accomplish by＿toying with Ryuuji?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Disculpa? ¡No me hagas reír! ¿Qué＿pretendes lograr jugando así con Ryuuji?」"

msgid "Ami「I think YOU'RE the one who's toying＿with him. Ryuuji is not your servant,＿okay? Why do you walk all over him?」"
msgstr "Ami「Creo que TÚ eres la que juega con＿él. Ryuuji no es tu sirviente, ¿sí?＿¿Por qué lo pisoteas tanto?」"

msgid "Taiga「This is none of your business, you＿washed-up model! Ryuuji is my dog!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Esto no es asunto tuyo, modelo＿fracasada! ¡¡Ryuuji es mi perro!!」"

msgid "Ami「Of course it's my business. Ryuuji is＿special to me.」"
msgstr "Ami「Claro que es asunto mío. Ryuuji＿es especial para mí.」"

msgid "Taiga「Quit saying that, you terrible person!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Deja de decir eso, eres horrible!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, cut it out already!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡Taiga, ya basta!!」"

msgid "Taiga「How dare you, you rotten mongrel!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Cómo te atreves, perro sarnoso!!」"

msgid "Taiga「Wha!? ......Y-You're saying...... Ryuuji,＿you'd believe StuChi over me?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Qué?! ......D-Dices que......＿Ryuuji, ¿le crees a Chihuatonta＿antes que a mí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, that's right!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Sí, así es!」"

msgid "Taiga「......Whatever. I won't concern myself＿with you ever again.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Como sea. No volveré a＿involucrarme contigo nunca más.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Suit yourself.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Como quieras.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry, Ami-chan. Taiga said a lot of＿terrible things......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón, Ami-chan. Taiga dijo muchas＿cosas horribles......」"

msgid "Ami「......Ufufu...... hehehe...... Ahahahahahaha!」"
msgstr "Ami「......Jujuju...... jeje...... ¡Jajajaja!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ami「Did you see it? That frustrated look on＿Tiger's face just now! Serves her right!＿So funny～!」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Viste eso? ¡La cara de frustración＿de Tigre hace un momento! ¡Se lo＿merece! ¡Qué gracioso～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ami-chan?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ami-chan?」"

msgid "Ami「Okay, Takasu-kun. You can go home＿now. You played your part well.」"
msgstr "Ami「Bueno, Takasu-kun. Ya puedes irte＿a casa. Cumpliste bien tu papel.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「My part......? Ami-chan, what's this all of＿a sudden?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mi papel......? Ami-chan, ¿a qué＿viene esto tan de repente?」"

msgid "Ami「You still don't get it～? I achieved my＿goal, so I'm done with you, Takasu-kun.＿Okay, byebye now～～」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Todavía no lo entiendes～? Ya logré＿mi objetivo, así que terminé contigo,＿Takasu-kun. Adiós～～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Why would you say that......? Where's＿the kind Ami-chan from before?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿P-Por qué dices eso......? ¿Dónde quedó＿la amable Ami-chan de antes?」"

msgid "Ami「Whaaat～? Right here①」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Quéee～? Justo aquí①」"

msgid "Ami「Just kidding. Ahahaha, what's with that＿face? I-D-I-O-T. Hahahahaha...... Aah,＿really, your derp face is good too～」"
msgstr "Ami「Era broma. Ajajaja, ¿y esa cara?＿I-D-I-O-T-A. Jajaja...... Aah, tu＿cara de bobo es buenísima～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're kidding! This isn't the Ami-chan＿I know!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Estás bromeando! ¡Esta no es＿la Ami-chan que yo conozco!」"

msgid "Ami「So obstinate～ Did you lose your＿common sense and vocabulary along＿with your memory? How very pitiful.」"
msgstr "Ami「Qué terco～ ¿Perdiste el sentido＿común y el vocabulario con tu＿memoria? Qué lástima das.」"

msgid "Ami「*Sigh*...... Why are you so convinced?＿It's scary.」"
msgstr "Ami「*Suspiro*...... ¿Por qué estás＿tan convencido? Da miedo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's alright. I know just how nice of a＿girl Ami-chan truly is.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien. Yo sé lo buena chica＿que es Ami-chan en realidad.」"

msgid "Ami「Ugh, what a pain～ So you just believe＿what you want?」"
msgstr "Ami「Agh, qué fastidio～ ¿Así que solo＿crees lo que quieres creer?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I believe in you, Ami-chan. My＿feelings won't change no matter what＿happens.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Yo creo en ti, Ami-chan.＿Mis sentimientos no cambiarán＿pase lo que pase.」"

msgid "Ami「............」"
msgstr "Ami「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I mean it!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡L-Lo digo en serio!」"

msgid "Ami「......Hmmm～ You like Ami-chan that＿much?」"
msgstr "Ami「......Mmm～ ¿Tanto te gusta Ami-chan?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí.」"

msgid "Ami「In that case, like, would you listen to＿anything Ami-chan says?」"
msgstr "Ami「En ese caso, o sea, ¿obedecerías＿todo lo que diga Ami-chan?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Of course!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Por supuesto!」"

msgid "Ami「Hmmm～...... Then......」"
msgstr "Ami「Mmm～...... Entonces......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ami-chan, here's your lunchbox and＿iced tea for today. Later I'll buy you＿your favorite magazine, too.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ami-chan, aquí tienes tu almuerzo＿y té helado de hoy. Luego te compraré＿tu revista favorita.」"

msgid "Ami「Oh my, thoughtful as always～」"
msgstr "Ami「Vaya, tan atento como siempre～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm doing this because I want to. Don't＿worry about it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Lo hago porque quiero. No＿te preocupes por eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Easy enough.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pan comido.」"

msgid "Kihara「Are you sure, Takasu-kun?」"
msgstr "Kihara「¿Estás seguro, Takasu-kun?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just leave it to me. You guys are＿Ami-chan's close friends, after all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Déjenmelo a mí. Después de todo, ustedes＿son amigas cercanas de Ami-chan.」"

msgid "Kashii「But I kinda feel bad.」"
msgstr "Kashii「Pero me siento un poco mal.」"

msgid "Ami「Ryuuji, why are you making Nanako＿feel the need to apologize?」"
msgstr "Ami「Ryuuji, ¿por qué haces que Nanako sienta＿que tiene que disculparse?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Sorry! It's fine, absolutely fine!＿Please let me make your lunches!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡P-Perdón! ¡Está bien, de verdad!＿¡Por favor, déjenme prepararles＿el almuerzo!」"

msgid "Kashii「If you insist, Takasu-kun......」"
msgstr "Kashii「Si insistes, Takasu-kun......」"

msgid "Ami「Then please do, starting tomorrow. Oh,＿and I wish this iced tea was like, hot＿instead～」"
msgstr "Ami「Entonces hazlo a partir de mañana.＿Ah, y ojalá este té helado＿estuviera caliente～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I'll replace it right now.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, lo cambio ahora mismo.」"

msgid "Ami「G-O-O-D～」"
msgstr "Ami「B-I-E-N～」"

msgid "Taiga「......Idiot.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Idiota.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「Nothing. Minorin, let's eat lunch＿together.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Nada. Minorin, vamos a almorzar juntas.」"

msgid "Minori「Okay～」"
msgstr "Minori「Está bien～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「――In the end, my memory didn't come＿back, and the last trimester finally＿arrived.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「――Al final, no recuperé la memoria, y＿por fin llegó el último trimestre.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But I think things are fine this way. I'm＿satisfied with my life.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero creo que así están bien las cosas.＿Estoy satisfecho con mi vida.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The daily life where I take orders from＿my beloved Ami-chan......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「La vida diaria en la que sigo las＿órdenes de mi amada Ami-chan......」"

msgid "Ami「Ryuujiii～ Like, come here for a sec①」"
msgstr "Ami「Ryuujiii～ O sea, ven un segundo①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ah, está bien!」"

msgid "Yuri「Hello. First of all, perhaps I should＿thank you for your hard work,＿Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Hola. Antes que nada, quizá debería＿agradecerte por tu esfuerzo, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Now that you got this ending, the＿reason I brought you here......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ahora que llegaste a este final, la＿razón por la que te traje aquí......」"

msgid "Yuri「......is none other than to discuss the＿route you chose. I thought we could＿ponder it together.」"
msgstr "Yuri「......no es otra que hablar sobre＿tu ruta. Pensé que podríamos＿reflexionar juntos.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's evaluate the ending you＿just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, entonces evaluemos el＿final que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「Welcome, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bienvenido, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's begin to evaluate the＿ending you just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, comencemos a evaluar el＿final que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「I see...... So you chose to become＿Kawashima-san's servant, Takasu-kun.＿I'll jot that down...」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ya veo...... Así que elegiste ser＿el sirviente de Kawashima-san,＿Takasu-kun. Lo anotaré...」"

msgid "Yuri「Well, Kawashima-san is cute. As long＿as you consent to it, it might be its＿own form of happiness, but......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bueno, Kawashima-san es linda.＿Si estás de acuerdo, puede que＿sea felicidad, pero......」"

msgid "Yuri「As your teacher, I want you to＿understand much more of＿Kawashima-san.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Como tu profesora, quiero que comprendas＿mucho mejor a Kawashima-san.」"

msgid "Yuri「With just a shallow understanding of＿her, she's bound to get tired of you in＿no time.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Si solo la comprendes de forma＿superficial, seguro se cansará＿de ti en poco tiempo.」"

msgid "Yuri「Besides, it seems there are a lot of＿things you haven't remembered. Did＿you forget about the Culture Festival?」"
msgstr "Yuri「Además, parece que hay muchas cosas＿que no recuerdas. ¿Olvidaste lo＿del Festival Cultural?」"

msgid "Yuri「For more information, you should try＿talking to the friends you spent time＿with at the Culture Festival.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Para saber más, habla con tus amigos＿del Festival Cultural.」"

msgid "Yuri「Now then. If I were to grade this＿ending, I guess I'd give it 60 points. It＿seems you'll need to try much harder.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ahora bien. Si calificara este final,＿le daría 60 puntos. Tendrás que＿esforzarte mucho más.」"

msgid "Yuri「Okay, that's all for today. Until next＿time!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bueno, eso es todo por hoy.＿¡Hasta la próxima!」"

msgid "『Music』 is now available in 『Extra』"
msgstr "『Música』 ya está disponible en 『Extra』"

msgid "『Album』 is now available in 『Extra』"
msgstr "『Álbum』 ya está disponible en 『Extra』"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's what you call me, too. And why＿do you keep calling her \"stupid＿chihuahua\" or \"evil\" or \"sex-crazed\"?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así me llamas a mí también. ¿Y por＿qué le dices \"chihuahua tonta\",＿\"malvada\" o \"pervertida\"?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Cut it out already.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya déjalo de una vez.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just listen to me! Ami-chan is worried＿about my amnesia from the bottom of＿her heart!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Solo escúchame! ¡Ami-chan está＿preocupada por mi amnesia desde＿el fondo de su corazón!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I won't forgive anyone who insults her,＿even if it's you, Taiga!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No perdonaré a nadie que la insulte,＿aunque seas tú, Taiga!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I see! This is an act, right? You're a＿totally nice girl - you're just pretending＿to be a bad girl right now......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡Ya veo! Es una actuación,＿¿verdad? Eres una chica súper buena,＿solo finges ser mala......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「How modest. I'm deeply moved!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qué modesta. ¡Estoy muy conmovido!」"

msgid "Ami「Oh yeah. Starting tomorrow, will you＿make some for Maya and Nanako?＿They want to eat your cooking.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ah, sí. A partir de mañana, ¿les＿prepararías a Maya y a Nanako?＿Quieren probar tu comida.」"

msgid "Ami「Okay～?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Sí～?」"

msgid "Yuri「I'll come and see you every time you＿reach an ending.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Vendré a verte cada vez＿que alcances un final.」"

msgid "Yuri「I want you to reflect on the actions you＿made this time and keep them in mind＿for next time.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Quiero que reflexiones sobre＿tus decisiones y las tengas en＿cuenta para la próxima.」"
